<view class="page-shell echo-page"><view class="eyebrow">A RESPONSE TO KEEP · 星光回响</view><view class="echo-title">给这段连接，留一句回应</view><block wx:if="{{phase === 'ready'}}"><view class="echo-intro">{{pair.pair.signA}} × {{pair.pair.signB}} · {{relationName}}</view><view class="echo-note">朋友打开后，可以从三个轻量回应里选一个。回应只保存在当前设备，不会分享昵称、性别或私人信息。</view><view class="response-list"><button wx:for="{{responseOptions}}" wx:key="id" class="response-option" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="choose"><view class="response-mark">0{{index + 1}}</view><view><view class="response-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="response-caption">{{item.text}}</view></view><text>→</text></button></view></block><block wx:elif="{{phase === 'revealed'}}"><view class="echo-card"><view class="echo-card-topline">{{pair.pair.signA}} × {{pair.pair.signB}} · {{relationName}}</view><view class="echo-card-title">{{response.title}}</view><view class="echo-card-text">{{response.text}}</view><view class="echo-card-advice"><view>给这段连接的一小步</view><view>{{response.action}}</view></view><view class="echo-card-footnote">星光只提供一个角度，真正的回应来自你们自己。</view></view><button class="primary-button" style="width:100%" open-type="share">分享这张回应卡 ↗︎</button><button class="ghost-button" style="width:100%;margin-top:18rpx" bindtap="openPair">我也想展开一组双人星图</button></block><view wx:if="{{phase === 'error'}}" class="echo-error">{{error}}<button class="ghost-button" style="width:100%;margin-top:22rpx" bindtap="openPair">重新展开双人星图</button></view><view class="echo-footnote">无账号 · 无云端同步 · 仅供娱乐与自我探索</view></view>
